cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code and derived aggregates for: Upper-Tropospheric Water-Vapor Profiles Steepen With Sea Surface Temperature and Turn Near 303 K Over Tropical Oceans"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived cell-regime aggregates supporting a two-layer
  upper-tropospheric water-vapor profile-shape benchmark (dlnq) built from Aura
  MLS version-5 humidity collocated with ERA5 sea-surface temperature and 500 hPa
  vertical velocity and NOAA interpolated outgoing longwave radiation, covering
  2 August 2004 to 30 December 2023.
type: software
